[story of bee unable to go upstairs deleted]

It's a bug, of course.  (No pun intended.)

The game considers you to be too loaded down to climb stairs if the difference
between your current and maximum inventory weight is 5 or less.  The trouble
with this is that bees have such a low maximum that even if they have
zero inventory weight, this is still a less than 5 difference from their
maximum.

The bug should be fixed in patchlevel 4...
